00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:41.340
amid ongoing displacement.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.080
The Guardian highlights statements from Lebanese Prime Minister

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:48.180
in Noof Salam that the country continues to endure

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.520
war and destruction.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:53.240
Both sides agree strikes occurred and casualties resulted.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:55.600
They differ on whether the actions respond

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.660
to specific threats or represent broader pressure

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:00.040
on the ceasefire framework.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.840
How are displacement orders communicated

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:04.660
and enforced in affected areas?

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.780
Next, we turn to the effects on British households.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.980
Britain's energy regulator announced a new price cap

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.460
