00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:55.740
Meanwhile, Cuba has appealed for support at the United Nations.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.860
Cuban Foreign Minister Bruno Rodriguez

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.760
